    <string name="guard_router_router_help_country_source">Automatic selection uses a fresh country result for the router’s internet connection. Phone and VPN location data are not used. If unavailable, previous rules stay unchanged; choose the country manually.</string>
    <string name="guard_router_router_help_home">Uses the router at home and restores the phone’s previous connection when you leave, if automatic switching is supported.</string>
    <string name="guard_router_router_help_install_server">Enable only if this router will accept VPN connections from your devices over a public IP address. This installs a separate server package and increases memory use. You can configure access after installation.</string>
